  "details": "# Issue\n\nWhen the SteamVR resolution changes, such as when using the [OpenVR Dynamic Resolution Utility](https://github.com/Louka3000/OpenVR-Dynamic-Resolution) to dynamically scale the player's resolution, video players *break* in the following ways:\n\n- Video either freezes or does not load\n\n- Audio plays back, but is stuttered and choppy\n\n- Issue can be remedied via scrubbing or by reloading the video, but not by pausing or manually resyncing",
